          "title": "开放电路",
          "content": "<p>去年，美国出版了一本名为《开放电路：电子元件的内在美》（Open Circuits: The Inner Beauty of Electronic Components）的书籍。</p>\n<p>该书详细介绍各种基础电子元件，最特别的地方是，它有许多精美的插图，将电子元件剖开展示。下图是一个电容器的垂直截面图。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023081601.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>你能认出以下是哪种电子元件吗？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023081602.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023081603.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "开放电路",
              "url": "https://pluralistic.net/2023/08/14/hidden-worlds/#making-the-invisible-visible-and-beautiful"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023081601.webp",
